110: \subsection{Squeezed State Graviton}
111: 
112: Two-mode squeezed state:
113: 
114: \begin{equation}
115: |G_{ij}\rangle = S_{ij}(r,\phi)|0\rangle
116: \end{equation}
117: 
118: where squeezing operator:
119: 
120: \begin{equation}
121: S_{ij}(r,\phi) = \exp\left(re^{i\phi}\hat{a}_i^\dagger\hat{a}_j^\dagger - re^{-i\phi}\hat{a}_i\hat{a}_j\right)
122: \end{equation}
123: 
124: Quadrature operators:
125: 
126: \begin{equation}
127: \hat{X}_i = \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}(\hat{a}_i + \hat{a}_i^\dagger), \quad \hat{P}_i = \frac{i}{\sqrt{2}}(\hat{a}_i^\dagger - \hat{a}_i)
128: \end{equation}
129: 
130: Variance reduction:
131: 
132: \begin{equation}
133: \langle(\hat{X}_i - \hat{X}_j)^2\rangle = e^{-2r}, \quad \langle(\hat{P}_i + \hat{P}_j)^2\rangle = e^{2r}
134: \end{equation}
135: 
136: Total uncertainty preserved:
137: 
138: \begin{equation}
139: \Delta(\hat{X}_i - \hat{X}_j)\Delta(\hat{P}_i + \hat{P}_j) = e^{-2r} \cdot e^{2r} = 1 \geq \frac{1}{2}
